A godpiercer is a spike the [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin/Damien|forge-heart]] in [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin/index|the lava ruin]] makes from divine energy and [[Phenomena/Holy Gold|holy gold]]. The one it made for the Weft is a foot long, bright white gold, and tapered to a point at one end.

Struck into a god it takes the divinity out of them and leaves them mortal. The [[Divinity/The Narrative/index|narrative]] let the Weft have it only on the promise that they use it inside their own sphere and never carry it out to another story. [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]] carries it, and the Weft mean it for [[People/Althane/The Broker|the Broker]] rather than for the thing they had first thought to use it on.
